Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 16:51:51 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 49/71] Clear the last traces of the AGENTS.md memory refresh

The generated config schema still listed `project_memory`, a comment in the
request statistics still named the memory turn, and `agents_md_paths` was
still crate-visible for a caller that no longer exists. Against the baseline
the only AGENTS.md-related difference left is the product rename.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RVZHG9H5htyFpi1B6xbmp8
---
 codex-rs/core/config.schema.json   | 6 ------
 codex-rs/core/src/agents_md.rs     | 2 +-
 codex-rs/core/src/request_stats.rs | 4 ++--
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/codex-rs/core/config.schema.json b/codex-rs/core/config.schema.json
index 9ab20f3b95..96209b0984 100644
--- a/codex-rs/core/config.schema.json
+++ b/codex-rs/core/config.schema.json
@@ -829,9 +829,6 @@
             "prevent_idle_sleep": {
               "type": "boolean"
             },
-            "project_memory": {
-              "type": "boolean"
-            },
             "prompt_cache_keep_alive": {
               "type": "boolean"
             },
@@ -6118,9 +6115,6 @@
         "prevent_idle_sleep": {
           "type": "boolean"
         },
-        "project_memory": {
-          "type": "boolean"
-        },
         "prompt_cache_keep_alive": {
           "type": "boolean"
         },
diff --git a/codex-rs/core/src/agents_md.rs b/codex-rs/core/src/agents_md.rs
index 0b62c05c6e..644407dd99 100644
--- a/codex-rs/core/src/agents_md.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/core/src/agents_md.rs
@@ -184,7 +184,7 @@ async fn read_agents_md(
 
 /// Discovers AGENTS.md files from the project root to the current working
 /// directory, inclusive. Symlinks are allowed.
-pub(crate) async fn agents_md_paths(
+async fn agents_md_paths(
     config: &Config,
     cwd: &PathUri,
     fs: &dyn ExecutorFileSystem,
diff --git a/codex-rs/core/src/request_stats.rs b/codex-rs/core/src/request_stats.rs
index 60fa263900..ec1b6550c7 100644
--- a/codex-rs/core/src/request_stats.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/core/src/request_stats.rs
@@ -262,8 +262,8 @@ impl RequestStats {
 
     /// Writes one row and clears the armed slot.
     ///
-    /// Called wherever the provider's usage lands, which covers ordinary turns, the project
-    /// memory turn, and compaction alike. Compaction builds its own prompt and never arms, so
+    /// Called wherever the provider's usage lands, which covers ordinary turns and compaction
+    /// alike. Compaction builds its own prompt and never arms, so
     /// its row carries the bill with the prompt columns null rather than with a stale report.
     /// Taking the slot is what guarantees that: a superseded record can never outlive its
     /// request.
